      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think it's just exhaustion though. it feels permanent. like the well is actually dry. it’s like looking at a blank canvas and knowing that no matter how long i stare, nothing is ever coming back. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life, waiting for the credits to roll.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
